# Turning off Show Starred in Navigator in the settings window drops the Starred entry at once and writes the setting.
size 100 30
file <<END
Work:
	- Report @star
END
keys g,
type /show starred
keys <Enter> <Enter>
see off
keys <Esc> <Esc> <C-g>
see 󰈻 Flagged
hide Starred
keys <Esc> gS
see - Report 󰓎  Work
quit
